    <h3>Avoidable Buying Mistakes</h3>
    <div class="mistake-box">
      <ul>
        <li>Choosing a fixture based on wattage alone instead of light quality and distribution</li>
        <li>Ignoring glare in screen-heavy work areas</li>
        <li>Ordering the wrong panel dimensions for the ceiling grid</li>
        <li>Failing to account for ceiling configuration (drop grid vs. hard ceiling)</li>
        <li>Not verifying ballast compatibility before ordering tube lights</li>
        <li>Selecting controls that aren't compatible with the fixture's dimming protocol</li>
