    <h2>PROFESSIONAL LIGHTING SELECTION &amp; COMPLIANCE REFERENCE</h2>

    <p class="lede">
      Essential compliance standards to verify before specifying or purchasing commercial fixtures.
    </p>

    <div class="ref-grid">

      <!-- 01 -->
      <div class="ref-card">
        <span class="ref-card__num">01</span>

        <h3>SAFETY &amp; CERTIFICATIONS</h3>

        <p class="key-standard">
          <strong>KEY STANDARDS:</strong> UL / ETL Listed, CSA
        </p>

        <p>
          Verify the safety listing required for building code clearance and local AHJ inspection.
          Match requirements to the specific mounting, application, and wet/hazardous environments.
        </p>

        <a href="https://www.nuwattlighting.com/blogs/news/guide-to-led-lighting-standards-and-certifications"
           class="btn-primary"
           style="margin-top: 5px;">
          Learn More
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 -->
      <div class="ref-card">
        <span class="ref-card__num">02</span>

        <h3>ENERGY &amp; STATE CODES</h3>

        <p class="key-standard">
          <strong>KEY STANDARDS:</strong> CA Title 24, ASHRAE 90.1, IECC
        </p>

        <p>
          Check state and regional energy mandates. Regulates lighting power density (LPD),
          mandatory controls (e.g., occupancy/daylight sensors), and California Title 24 compliance.
        </p>

        <a href="https://www.nuwattlighting.com/blogs/news/high-efficiency-lighting-big-tax-savings-with-section-179d"
           class="btn-primary"
           style="margin-top: 5px;">
          Learn More
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 -->
      <div class="ref-card">
        <span class="ref-card__num">03</span>

        <h3>LOCATION &amp; INGRESS</h3>

        <p class="key-standard">
          <strong>KEY STANDARDS:</strong> Damp / Wet, IP65 / IP66, NEMA
        </p>

        <p>
          Ensure rating suits where the fixture is installed. Use IP65/IP66 or wet-location for
          outdoors, hose-downs, and washdowns. Use damp-location for indoor high humidity.
        </p>

        <a href="https://www.nuwattlighting.com/blogs/news/choosing-commercial-lighting-for-different-installation-environments"
           class="btn-primary"
           style="margin-top: 5px;">
          Learn More
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 04 -->
